<mxfile host="drawio"><diagram name="Code changes"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="t" value="Seat choice — what changes in the code (screens: mockup canvas, boards « Choisir sa place » and « Place déjà réservée »)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1100" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lay" value="&lt;b&gt;SeatLayout&lt;/b&gt; (new, pure)&lt;br&gt;Plan from the vehicle: up to 4 passenger seats = &lt;b&gt;berline&lt;/b&gt; A1 | B1 B2 B3; 5 or 6 = &lt;b&gt;monospace&lt;/b&gt; A1 | B1 B2 B3 | C1 C2&lt;br&gt;Comfort order: A1, B1, B3, B2, C1, C2&lt;br&gt;offered(trip): the first &lt;i&gt;seatsOffered&lt;/i&gt; seats in that order; the others are « Non proposée »" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#E2C76B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="70" width="460" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="map" value="&lt;b&gt;SeatMap&lt;/b&gt; (new, pure)&lt;br&gt;For a portion (from stop, to stop), each seat is:&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;libre&lt;/b&gt;: nobody on any leg of the portion&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;libérée en route&lt;/b&gt;: free on the portion, taken elsewhere on the trip (yellow dot)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;occupée&lt;/b&gt;: someone on at least one leg of the portion&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;non proposée&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Counts CONFIRMED and COMPLETED bookings, like the seat counts&lt;br&gt;autoPick(n): free seats in comfort order, same row first when n &amp;gt; 1&lt;br&gt;A booking without seats (made before this change) gets seats in comfort order" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFF8DD;strokeColor=#E2C76B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="210" width="460" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bk" value="&lt;b&gt;Booking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;+ seatCodes (JSON, e.g. [&quot;B1&quot;, &quot;B2&quot;]); there are always as many as &lt;i&gt;seats&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;Migration adds the column; the demo data gets seats" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEF4FF;strokeColor=#9DB8F2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="70" width="460" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="svc" value="&lt;b&gt;BookingService.book(…, seatCodes = [])&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inside the existing lock on the trip row:&lt;br&gt;• no seat given: autoPick (« Pas de préférence, choisir pour moi »)&lt;br&gt;• seats given: each must be offered, distinct, free on the whole portion, and as many as the places booked&lt;br&gt;• otherwise &lt;b&gt;SeatTakenException&lt;/b&gt; (new); the per-leg seat count check stays as it is&lt;br&gt;Two people on the same seat at the same time: the lock makes one wait, then it fails cleanly" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEF4FF;strokeColor=#9DB8F2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="170" width="460" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pg" value="&lt;b&gt;Pages&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Trip page, « Réserver » opens &lt;b&gt;GET /trips/{id}/seats?from=&amp;amp;to=&amp;amp;seats=&lt;/b&gt; (new): « Choisissez votre place », car seen from above&lt;br&gt;• Seats are checkboxes, so it works without JavaScript; the &lt;b&gt;seat-picker&lt;/b&gt; Stimulus controller keeps at most N checked and updates « Votre place » and the button « Réserver les places B1 et B2 »&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;POST /trips/{id}/book&lt;/b&gt; + seats[]: success goes to the booking page; a seat taken meanwhile gives &lt;b&gt;409&lt;/b&gt; « La place B3 vient d&#x27;être réservée » with free seats suggested&lt;br&gt;• Booking page, driver trip page and back-office show « Place B1 »&lt;br&gt;• Privacy: a taken seat says « occupée », never who sits there" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EEF4FF;strokeColor=#9DB8F2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="340" width="460" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ex" value="&lt;b&gt;Example&lt;/b&gt; (Dacia Logan, Karim offers 3 places)&lt;br&gt;A1, B1, B3 open; B2 « Non proposée »&lt;br&gt;Mehdi books B3 from Agadir to Essaouira&lt;br&gt;Salma, Essaouira to Marrakech: B3 is « libérée en route », A1 and B1 are free&lt;br&gt;Rachid, Agadir to Marrakech: B3 is « occupée »" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F5F0E8;strokeColor=#C9B79C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="430" width="460" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tst" value="&lt;b&gt;Tests first (Opus)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• SeatLayout: both plans, comfort order, closed seats&lt;br&gt;• SeatMap: states on a portion, freed seat, a cancelled booking frees its seats&lt;br&gt;• BookingService: auto pick (same row), chosen seat taken, same seat on separate legs allowed, wrong or unoffered code refused, two people on one seat at once&lt;br&gt;• Pages: seat page, booking with seats, 409 page, seats shown on the booking and driver pages" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=12;fillColor=#E7F6EC;strokeColor=#8BCB9F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="570" width="980" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="uses" style="endArrow=open;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8A94A6;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="map" target="lay"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="uses" style="endArrow=open;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8A94A6;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="svc" target="map"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="saves" style="endArrow=open;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8A94A6;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="svc" target="bk"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="calls" style="endArrow=open;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#8A94A6;fontSize=11;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pg" target="svc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>